WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.283 --> 00:00:02.905
[MYSTERIOUS MUSIC]

00:00:04.875 --> 00:00:08.584
[BABY CRYING]

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.960
In six, we wanted to show how 
each of the family members

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.990
were equally culpable for what 
happened in the past event.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.700
It wasn't just Dorothy.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.830
How was Sean responsible for 
what happened to the child?

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:26.130
You learn in these flashbacks 
that he should have been there.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.200
And he feels really, 
really guilty about it.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.380
And it's driving part of his 
learning about the cult.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.640
Explain it to me.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.220
I know, she's special and you.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.240
But I don't understand.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.720
So please, tell me.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.720
I mean, it's definitely a
supernatural thriller.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:43.200
But as grounded as we can 
make the supernatural part

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.950
is the trick so it doesn't 
crack and it becomes ruleless.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.670
We want it to have rules.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:50.410
What was he saying about me?

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:53.370
He said we have to return 
you to where we found you.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:56.380
He said you're needed there, so--

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:58.660
And you believe him?

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:01.160
I don't know what I believe.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.250
For example, in this episode, we're

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.980
meant to learn what the 
ramifications are

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.330
of Leanne's actions.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:11.830
There's a little bit of Leanne 
taking on the personality

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.180
of the Turners' lives.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:16.150
And the house itself is 
taking on the presence

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:18.400
of her being in this home.

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:24.830
She caused this.

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:25.940
Some of it's cracking.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:27.650
Some of it's changing.

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:29.990
And I think we can all 
connect with the idea

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:33.140
that maybe there's something 
out there that we don't understand,

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.120
the unknown that we can't make sense of.

